INSERT INTO question_bank_2_examples (id, group_id, content, sequence)
VALUES (
  'db44d472-05f5-5a39-a9a2-1208dba69865', '54f2e13c-24a4-579e-a3e5-4f7cfb3ff83f',
  'Problem(s) of the following recursive algorithm?

```c
binary_search(A, T, L, R) {
    m=(L+R)/2;
    if (A[m] == T)
        return m;
    else if (A[m] < T)
        return binary_search(A, T, m+1, R);
    else
        return binary_search(A, T, L, m-1);
}
```

Lựa chọn:
- a. An incorrect recursive binary searching: never stop when T is not in A (or error accessing out of bound of A)
- b. Incorrect recursion implementation: missing base case.
- c. A correct recursive binary search.
- d. Incorrect recursion implementation: missing general case.', 3
);

