INSERT INTO question_bank_2_examples (id, group_id, content, sequence)
VALUES (
  '27a1c982-20d0-5917-8b54-d1e5c37fddcf', '54f2e13c-24a4-579e-a3e5-4f7cfb3ff83f',
  'Which is a recursive definition?

Lựa chọn:
- Print_reverse(list) does nothing when list is null, and calls Print_reverse(list->next) and then call print(list->data) otherwise.
- Fibonacci(n) is 1 when n in [0,1], and is Factorial(n-1)+Factorial(n-2) otherwise.
- SUM(n) is 0 when n=0, and is n*(n+1)/2 otherwise.
- Factorial(n) is 1 when n=0, and is n * (n-1) * ... * 2 * 1 when n>0.', 9
);

